    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: dc60395dafa64ab08f1f353a4e917912
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A broodmother (hive, egg-layer, drone carrier — any faction): spawns its brood (EnemyData › Kit › Summon) whenever it can, hangs back deep in cover or a bush and retreats further when pushed. Its brood dies with it: kill the mother.'
